---
description: Emit raw JSON only when the skill asks for structured output
globs: "**/*.{json,md,mdc}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# JSON only when asked

- When a skill requests JSON, emit a single JSON value with no markdown fences.
- Do not wrap JSON in commentary before or after the object.
- When a skill does not request JSON, use readable Markdown headings instead.
